sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Application command
    participant S as SQLite write owner
    participant D as Tokio dispatcher
    participant H as Native handler
    C->>S: State change and required delivery intents
    S->>S: Commit state history event and queue rows
    S-->>C: Durable receipt
    S-->>D: Best effort wakeup
    Note over S,D: Startup and bounded sweep recover missed wakeups
    D->>S: Claim eligible deliveries within available capacity
    S-->>D: Owner lease and fencing generation
    D->>H: Bounded mpsc dispatch
    H->>S: Recheck control and admit stable operation
    alt Database-only result
        H->>S: Commit handler effects delivery completion and follow-ups
    else External effect
        H->>H: Dispatch through normal effect broker
        H->>S: Save observation or Unknown outcome
        Note over H,S: Lost response requires reconciliation before retry
    end
    S-->>D: Durable outcome and eligible wakeups
    Note over C,H: Feature and issue restart holds still require Continue
